Package: artpixeltrace
Title: Pixel Trace Authentication and Certificate Engine
Version: 0.18.0
Authors@R: 
  person(
    given = "Bobby", 
    family = "Fatemi", 
    role = c("aut", "cre"), 
    email = "bobby@artalytics.app"
  )
Description: Measures normalized native-canvas, replay, and current-layer
  evidence with a versioned Pixel Trace evaluator, computes perceptual image
  fingerprints, and renders Certificates of Authenticity with the Typst engine
  (prep_coa_data() prepares supplied facts and render_coa() typesets) for
  the Artalytics platform.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/artalytics/artpixeltrace,
    https://docs.artalytics.dev/r/artpixeltrace
BugReports: https://github.com/artalytics/artpixeltrace/issues
SystemRequirements: 
    Typst for certificate typesetting, supplied by a standalone executable
    (TYPST_BIN or PATH) or the Quarto CLI (quarto typst compile;
    QUARTO_PATH or PATH),
    ImageMagick++ (libmagick++-dev),  
    Armadillo (libarmadillo-dev),  
    BLAS/LAPACK (libblas-dev, liblapack-dev),  
    ARPACK (libarpack++2-dev),  
    FFTW3 (libfftw3-dev),  
    JPEG (libjpeg-dev),  
    PNG (libpng-dev),  
    TIFF (libtiff5-dev),  
    Fortran compiler (gfortran)
